# Netlify redirects — Med&X ADMIN portal v2 (a future admin-v2 site). Order matters: first match wins.
# The staging admin backend lives BEHIND the launcher at https://medx-staging.onrender.com/__admin/…
# (deploy/staging/launcher.js strips the prefix), so every relative /api/… call from this site is
# proxied there (status 200 = proxy, URL unchanged). The member portal is reachable through /__member/*
# (health probe of GET /api/public/status, note 0b). Placeholder host: medx-staging.onrender.com — `sed`
# it (or scripts/apply-config.js staging --host …) to the real Render host on deploy.
# Deploy copies this file to the publish root (netlify.toml build command).
/api  https://medx-staging.onrender.com/__admin/api  200
/api/*  https://medx-staging.onrender.com/__admin/api/:splat  200
/uploads/*  https://medx-staging.onrender.com/__admin/uploads/:splat  200
/photo-library/*  https://medx-staging.onrender.com/__admin/photo-library/:splat  200
/health  https://medx-staging.onrender.com/__admin/health  200
/newsletter  https://medx-staging.onrender.com/__admin/newsletter  200
/review  https://medx-staging.onrender.com/__admin/review  200
/evaluate  https://medx-staging.onrender.com/__admin/evaluate  200
/apply  https://medx-staging.onrender.com/__admin/apply  200
/e/*  https://medx-staging.onrender.com/__admin/e/:splat  200
/a/*  https://medx-staging.onrender.com/__admin/a/:splat  200
/__admin/*  https://medx-staging.onrender.com/__admin/:splat  200
/__staging/*  https://medx-staging.onrender.com/__staging/:splat  200
/__member/*  https://medx-staging.onrender.com/:splat  200

# SPA fallback — every client route (/today, /projects/plexus, /inbox …) renders the shell
/*  /index.html  200
